NOUVEAU CRASHES ON GEFORCE 360M

Nouveau driver crashed both KUBUNTU 10.10 Alphas 1 and 2, and openSUSE RC 1
and 2.

 

I could only manage to install both OSs by not installing or using nouveau
drivers.

 

Also, I managed to successful use nvidia's proprietary drivers.


